editor_description = "Base of every ThrowPaperBall layout (layouts are inherited scenes of this one) and the root Node2D for all physical nodes of the minigame.
Is located at the centre of local minigame space.
Layout authoring: a TrashCan movement Path2D goes here as a sibling of TrashCan, never as its child; keep the can clear of the walls and floor by more than the ball's diameter."
